{time.time()-t0:.1f}s\")\n'","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_40a99333","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Testing larger n with MILP","toolSummary":"Check larger n for counterexample"}}]}
